{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pixel Detective: Curse of the Paintings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pixel-art mystery short story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Nathan, a seasoned private investigator, as a cryptic phone call draws him into a case filled with secrets, strange paintings, and suspicious characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Quiet Office, A Disturbing Call</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nathan\u2019s routine day is interrupted by a cryptic phone call \u2014 and nothing feels quite right after that. A subtle opening scene that draws you into the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002850/extras/e5379dbe932c46708444195caf2d5093.webp?t=1768662784\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002850/extras/e5379dbe932c46708444195caf2d5093.poster.avif?t=1768662784\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Late-Night Talks at the Bar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversations flow as smoothly as the drinks. Secrets slip in between the sips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with colorful characters and learn the truth in this moody bar setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002850/extras/72c0ad7a61527781a18a0264bc50a785.webp?t=1768662784\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002850/extras/72c0ad7a61527781a18a0264bc50a785.poster.avif?t=1768662784\" class=\"bb_img\" width=750 height=750 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Culinary Alchemy - A Deadly Award</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not your average recipe book. Poison included.\u00a0An award-winning cookbook with a curious reputation. What makes it so special?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002850/extras/9ef875345b650f2c5d372647fa2dc5fe.avif?t=1768662784\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002850?t=1768662784","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002850?t=1768662784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002850/6311e17ee023367e67b047b0fe74b0f96dec6de5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768662784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002850/6311e17ee023367e67b047b0fe74b0f96dec6de5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768662784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of pixelated violence, blood, and scenes of death, including poisoning and injury. Although the visuals are stylized in pixel-art, some players may find certain themes disturbing. There are also references to alcohol in the game.\r\n\r\nNo sexual content or nudity is present. The game does not include any depiction of sexual assault, non-consensual acts, or self-harm.\r\n\r\nPlayer discretion is advised due to scenes involving murder and crime investigation."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pixel Detective: Curse of the Paintings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragr